# 40. The new master equation

I'd now replace the previous simple score with:

$$
\boxed{
Alpha_i=
\sum_{s,t}
\underbrace{
(P_{ours}(s,t)-P_{market}(s,t))
}_{belief\ gap}
\times
\underbrace{
\Delta CF_i(s,t)
}_{cashflow\ effect}
\times
\underbrace{
X_i(s)
}_{cross-world\ exposure}
\times
\underbrace{
B_i(s,t)
}_{scarcity}
\times
\underbrace{
R_i(t)
}_{irreducibility}
-
\underbrace{
C_i(t)
}_{crowdedness}
}
$$

but make bottleneck severity itself endogenous:

$$
B_i
=
\frac{
\text{induced demand}
\times
\text{indispensability}
\times
\text{replacement time}
\times
\text{permission friction}
}{
\text{available capacity}
+
\text{substitutes}
+
\text{inventory}
}
$$

and model:

$$
\frac{dB_i}{dt}
$$

rather than only \(B_i\).

